This directory must exist and must stay empty.

Exist: StaticWebAssetsLoader resolves it at startup and throws
DirectoryNotFoundException if it is missing, before any configuration is read.

Empty: MapFallbackToFile serves whatever index.html lands here on every
extensionless unmatched path, in production too — the Development-only guard on
the Scalar endpoint does not apply to static files. It previously held a Scalar
page that loaded its script from a public CDN, unpinned and without SRI, on the
same origin whose localStorage holds the session token and the E2EE private key.
